### Fetch All Results
GET http://localhost:9000/results
Content-Type: application/json

### Add a New Result
POST http://localhost:9000/results
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "result_user_id": "user752",
  "result_test_id": "test456",
  "result_score": 97,
  "result_poc_id": "poc789"
}

### Update a Result
PUT http://localhost:9000/results/ae61a25e-8a3f-423e-8417-1688a0494651
Content-Type: application/json

{
   "result_user_id": "user752",
  "result_test_id": "test27",
  "result_score": 97,
  "result_poc_id": "poc789"
}


### Delete a Result
DELETE http://localhost:9000/results/9221453f-3be2-4a2d-8ec4-452ba4fe01b8
Content-Type: application/json